WEBVTT

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.370
I'm home.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.860
Oh, Kaoru-sama.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.050
Welcome home.

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.970
Y-Yeah...

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.000
Huh?

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.300
Why am I in a business suit?

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.960
T-This situation...

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:03.930
Could it be...

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.850
Aoi-chan and I are married
and are husband and wife?

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.810
Is that right, Aoi-chan?

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:11.730
Yes!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.740
Which means...

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.110
This is...

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.110
a dream?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.490
What's wrong?

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:23.580
For some reason, you seem
a bit strange today, Kaoru-sama.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.370
Kaoru-sama, would you like to have dinner?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.500
Or would you rather take a bath?

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:32.660
W-Well, then...

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:35.800
Dinner, maybe?

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.580
Eh!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.780
Already?

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.570
Yeah.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.220
Please wait a moment.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.940
H-Here you are.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.810
Please eat up...

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.560
<i>P-Please eat up?</i>

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.060
Heh?

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.070
Dinner is...

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.500
Kaoru-sama!

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.430
If you don't hurry up and eat,

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.040
your dinner will get cold.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.420
T-This is a dream, right?

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:12.290
Oh, it's a dream, after all!

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.040
A-Aoi-chan!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.780
K-Kaoru-sama!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:21.790
Please eat gently.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:26.760
If you don't, I will surely break.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.060
Aoi-chan!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.410
Y-You mustn't, Kaoru-sama.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.130
It's all right, isn't it?

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.930
We're married, anyway?

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.010
A-Ah! A-Aoi-chan?

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.880
Why are you in my futon?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.720
I-I'm sorry to have startled you.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.130
Actually, you see...

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:02.510
It's because I wanted to sleep in your futon, so...

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.260
Eh!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.120
And then, all of the sudden...

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.390
Aoi-chan.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.230
Kaoru-sama.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.150
Tina-senpai!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.650
Please wake up!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.840
Breakfast is getting cold!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.240
Just a little longer.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.640
Geez! Please hurry up!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.390
I'm sorry, Kaoru-sama.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.320
I'm going to head out first.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.790
Okay.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.970
{Thank you for the food}Itadakimasu!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.670
Tennis?

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:50.940
Yeah.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:54.890
I'll be playing tennis on
the next school field day.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.980
Chika-rin, are you good at tennis?

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.020
Not at all.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.730
That's why I want to practice.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.990
Tennis, huh?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.410
It'd be fun if I could play tennis with Aoi-chan...

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.700
If you're speaking of tennis...

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:13.360
Miyabi-san is very good at it.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.660
{Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.670
Wow, Miyabi Onee-chan.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.080
You can do anything.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.930
I haven't held a racket in some time...

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:24.720
but if that's all right, I'll go along with you.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.740
Really?

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.240
All right!

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.100
Thanks, Miyabi Onee-chan!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.980
Kaoru, you'll play tennis too, right?

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:32.930
Y-Yeah.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.250
Then it's decided!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.420
We'll have a tennis meet today!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.730
Yeah!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.770
Then, I have to prepare lunch.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.770
All right!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.950
That's right.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.780
I guess we're done once we take this.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.030
Yes.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:52.120
We didn't forget anything, right?

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.080
Then...

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.380
Shall we go?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.640
Y-Yeah.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.970
I'm sorry, Kaoru-sama.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.220
Are you all right, Aoi-chan?

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.600
M-Miyabi-san!

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.000
Aoi-sama, Tina-san is calling for you.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.130
Ah, yes!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:28.820
Then, I'll leave too.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.700
Kaoru-dono.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.360
Yes?

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:37.780
For Aoi-sama's sake, I have
approved of your relationship.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:44.750
But the Sakuraba Group has not yet formally approved of your relationship in its entirety.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:50.430
We still need to keep your relationship a secret.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.220
Do you understand?

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:53.220
Yes...

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.650
{Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.520
Hurry!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.540
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.340
Yes, yes!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.530
One more time!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.570
All right! All right! All right! All right! All right!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.570
Ouch, Tina-senpai, it hurts!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.740
It'll snap! It'll snap!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:12.150
It's been a while.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.660
My arms are itching to go.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.910
But still...

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.420
It's kind of hard to figure out where to look.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.500
Kaoru-sama.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.340
Aoi-chan.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.910
Kaoru-sama, is something the matter?

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.210
No.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:40.100
Just thinking it's different from your usual outfit.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.600
Please don't look at me so much.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.150
It's e-embarrassing.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.770
That's not so.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:47.440
It's cute.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.210
Kaoru-sama.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:51.380
Aoi-chan.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.650
Take that!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.430
Oh, Tina-san!

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.590
It's all right.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.700
You're wearing an underskirt, after all.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.210
It is not all right!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.670
Take that!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.370
Senpai!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.040
Kaoru, you should act childish and try it!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.870
You flipped up girls' skirts as a kid, right?

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:10.630
As if I do!

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:15.140
Very well, we will first start with receiving practice.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.480
Please return the balls I hit to you.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.600
Okay!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.350
We will start with Tina-san.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:22.770
All right!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.180
Bring it on!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.650
A perfect ball, high and outside!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.880
All right!

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.690
It's a double!

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:41.440
Tina Nee-chan, that's baseball you're doing.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.480
Senpai, please be serious about this!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.050
Kaoru-sama.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.550
Eh! What?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.260
Your shoelace is loose.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.890
Okay, now it's fine.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.310
Thanks, Aoi-chan.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.130
Next, Taeko-san!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.030
Tae Nee-chan, are you okay?

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:23.050
Really, Tae-chin always
shows us such hilarious things.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.920
Next, Chika-san!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.170
Okay!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.990
I became the same as Tae Nee-chan.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.880
Maybe the Minazuki family isn't suited to tennis.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.430
Heh?!

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.100
Next, Aoi-sama!

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:39.800
Right.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.760
Aoi-chan,

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.070
I wonder if she'll be okay!

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.540
If she ends up like Taeko-chan...

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.730
Oh, no!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.810
Ready?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.140
Yes!

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:10.650
Next!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.900
Wow, Aoi Onee-chan!

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.400
You know how to play tennis?

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.720
Yes, though I only dabble in it.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.780
Hey, hey, let's try a doubles match next!

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:29.510
Oh, trying to improve by practicing
what you've learned, Chika-rin?

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:47.060
Kaoru-sama, please relax.
Let's just have a carefree game.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.210
O-Okay.

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.940
I can't play a carefree game at this rate.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.940
Here I go!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:30.160
There.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:41.990
It seems more like ping-pong than tennis, right?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.970
I messed up.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.210
Chika-rin!

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.720
You have to put more <i>power</i> into it to win! <i>Power!</i>

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.320
Let me serve awhile.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.010
Sorry, Chika-rin.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:12.360
Here we go.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:12.870
Right.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.300
Kaoru-sama?

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.510
Aoi-chan, shall we switch?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.420
I did it!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.480
I won! I won!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.620
Damn, I won't lose next time.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.850
Take that!

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.980
I never knew Aoi-chan was so good at tennis.

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.470
Yes, really.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:58.900
You're incredible.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.420
Look out, {Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.130
Eh!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.450
Oh sorry, Kaoru!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.430
I kind of lost control.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.390
I-It's okay.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.520
Don't pay it any mind.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.190
And the game is set, isn't it?

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:23.760
Yes.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.070
I lost.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:28.780
Nice game.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.950
I still can't beat Miyabi-san, can I?

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.260
Aoi-chan, you're good at tennis, aren't you?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.850
If it's all right with you, Kaoru-sama,

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.590
shall we play together next?

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.050
Yeah.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.630
I'm tired.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:53.060
Tennis really tires you out, doesn't it?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.270
No kidding.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.850
After moving so much, I'd like
to have lost five or six kilograms.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.900
There's no way you would lose that much!

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:05.510
Tennis is an elegant and beautiful sport.

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:08.740
It's not a beast's exercise to reduce her waistline.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.580
Why are you here, Mayucchi?

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:18.020
It isn't so easy to leave me behind,
and go off to play with Hanabishi-sama!

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.500
Hanabishi-sama!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.260
Hey!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.200
Hanabishi-sama.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.390
M-Mayu-chan!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:25.360
Will you play tennis with Mayu next?

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.630
Stop holding on to Kaoru!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.730
Is it all right, Hanabishi-sama?

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:31.520
Hey there!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.220
There!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.960
Take that!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:38.890
There!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.900
Mayu-chan, you're pretty good at tennis.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.560
It's tennis as it's done in its homeland of England.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.390
I was playing against you, Hanabishi-sama.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:57.370
So it would be rude not to play my best.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:14:59.680
I see.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.710
Here, Kaoru-sama.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.500
Oh, thanks.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.340
Ah!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.410
I feel alive again!

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.710
Tina Nee-chan, we're still in a match!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.340
I'm coming now!

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.650
Oh, it's already empty.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.460
There's another canteen in the car.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.400
Oh, then I will go and get it.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:36.200
Oh, I'll accompany...

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.910
Look out, {Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.540
Heh!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.140
Hanabishi-sama!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.200
A-Are you all right, Senpai?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.880
Sorry, Kaoru.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.500
Don't mind! Don't mind!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.520
Chika-rin!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.190
What?

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:09.170
Cut it out, Tina Nee-chan!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.130
Breast inspection time!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.030
Next is Tae-chin.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.990
Tae, Tae-chin!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.290
Check!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.170
No!

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.680
Please stop it!

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:19.950
And next up is Mayucchi!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.910
Check!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.260
What are you doing?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.260
I can hear all that over here...

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.620
Now, {the manager}Kanrinin...

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.580
Check!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.670
H-Hey, Tina-san!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.590
Next is Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.180
Aoi-chan!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.890
I-I...

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.720
Please stop, Tina-san!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.630
But it's all right, isn't it? Isn't it?

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.140
Check!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.660
Hot, hot, hot!

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:03.830
I didn't have much chance alone with Aoi-chan.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:15.770
But if I was in that apartment
with Aoi-chan, just the two of us...

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.930
We'd go shopping together.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.600
We'd take baths together.

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:23.660
And...

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.890
we'd be together at sleep time, too!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:32.320
A life for just the two of us would be nice!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.400
Ouch!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.350
This is nice in its own way, though.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.860
What's wrong, Senpai?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.360
Ah, nothing, um...

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.560
Kaoru-sama?

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:22.260
No, I just thought something smelled great.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:26.640
Supposedly, everyone is tired today.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:29.540
So I thought I'd make dishes that replenish energy.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.730
I see.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.710
Is there any way I can help?

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.910
No, everything is fine.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:37.070
I see.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.220
It will be ready soon.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.510
Okay.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.890
That's right, Kaoru-sama.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.330
There is something I'd like help with.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.310
Is that all right?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.150
Heh?! Ah, yeah.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.530
I am sorry, Taeko-san.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.770
Take care of things a little longer.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:18:59.400
Okay.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.440
Um, Aoi-chan.

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.100
You needed help...

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:11.720
Okay, Kaoru-sama.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.630
Do you want something with me?

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.380
Eh!

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:16.090
Oh, no, well...

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.710
Was I that obvious?

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:25.730
But it was kind of unusual
for you to be so good at tennis.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:27.720
Really?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:29.930
Yeah.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:33.610
There's still a lot about you I don't know, Aoi-chan.

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.270
Were you surprised?

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.820
I was surprised.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:42.540
From now on, I'll continue
to show you more of my secrets.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.790
Ah, Aoi-chan.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:58.030
Yes?

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:58.850
Um...

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.080
See, Aoi-chan.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:06.320
M-May I k-kiss you?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.730
Yes...

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.660
I'm sorry doing this all of the sudden.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.760
No.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:32.370
I'm so happy that you're fawning on me.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:36.560
Because, I've been fawning on you too, Kaoru-sama.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.870
Actually, this is our second kiss today.

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.210
Then...

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.770
Before I woke up?

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.200
I love you.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.390
Kaoru-sama!

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:39.540
<i>On kiri kiri. On kiri kiri.</i>

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.890
Exactly, what are you doing?

00:22:42.890 --> 00:22:45.860
Well, actually, behind you, Miyabi-san...

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:47.800
Ah, it's all right.

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:49.890
It's a person, person. I'll exorcise it right away.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:50.760
A person?

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:51.840
W-Where?

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:54.970
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:56.100
Phantoms.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.600
Oh my, I messed up!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:01.610
Huh, what?! Behind me?! A person?! Eh!

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:04.480
T-Taeko-san!
